# ── Build artifact ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Single-file preview, regenerated by Scripts/build_preview.ps1.
# Kept out of the repo on purpose: it is ~2 MB (1.3 MB of duplicated three.js
# plus the inlined sample JSON).
# Need it locally?  powershell -File Scripts/build_preview.ps1
# Need it in the repo?  git add -f preview.html
preview.html

# ── R leftovers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rplots.pdf shows up whenever a script draws without opening a device.
Rplots.pdf
*.Rhistory
*.RData
# …but the workspace snapshots under rds/ ARE the sample inputs (same role as
# the .rds files next to them): without them samples/RepresentativeTree.json
# cannot be re-exported from a clone. They are small now (216 KB), so keep them.
!rds/*.RData
*.Rproj
.Rproj.user/

# ── OS / editor noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
~$*

# ── Not used by this project, but cheap to guard against ────────────────
node_modules/
.vscode/
.idea/
